  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "At the Northern Plains Zombie Alliance headquarters, Fang Yuan reaches a large hall whose doors are flanked by tall stone statues bulkier than even his eight arm immortal zombie physique. Gu Ye names Yin Liu Gong as one of three deputy city lords who can command immortal zombies to fight.",
      "chapters": [
