        "char_yin_liu_gong"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Pressed by Yao Huang for immortal zombie materials, Yin Liu Gong says he holds two immortal zombie bodies of Zombie Alliance traitors, sealed with stone casket and set as defenses for the discussion hall doors, not to be mobilized under normal circumstances. He refuses to dig up past immortal zombies from the Earth Trench graveyard, and he will not release those sealed traitors for the refinement plan either.",
